!Name: p24block
!C A period 24 c/3 puffer which produces a block every period.  It was formed
!C by perturbing the exhaust of a period 54 c/3 puffer such that the perturbation
!C reproduces itself each period.
!C David I. Bell, April 1996
!Source: jslife-moving
